# Copy to client/.env — gitignored. Everything prefixed VITE_ is compiled into
# the browser bundle and is public; never put a secret here.

# Origin the API is served from, with no trailing slash and no path — the /api
# prefix comes from the typed RPC route itself.
#
# Leave unset in development: the Vite dev server proxies /api to the Hono
# process on :3000, which keeps the API same-origin and avoids CORS entirely.
# Set it only when the deployed frontend and API live on different origins.
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://api.example.com
